 "holes": [],
 "lines": {
  "1": "Ruma: Hello, Ankit? Main Rohan ki mummy bol rahi hoon, Ruma Das. Sharma aunty ne aapka number diya tha.\n",
  "2": "Ankit: Haan ji namaste aunty, Sharma aunty ne bataya tha. Rohan class eight mein hai na?\n",
  "3": "Ruma: Haan eighth mein hai, DPS mein. Maths aur science dono mein weak hai, especially maths, half yearly mein bahut kam aaye.\n",
  "4": "Ankit: Koi baat nahi aunty, eighth ka maths main kaafi bachchon ko padha chuka hoon. Main ghar aake padhaunga, Monday se Friday, shaam paanch se saadhe chhe, chalega?\n",
  "5": "Ruma: Haan woh time theek hai, chaar baje woh school se aata hai, thoda kha pee leta hai. Fees kitni loge?\n",
  "6": "Ankit: Dono subject ke chaar hazaar mahina, aunty.\n",
  "7": "Ruma: Chaar hazaar theek hai. Kab se start kar sakte ho?\n",
  "8": "Ankit: Ek December se. Aur March mein final exam tak padhaunga, uske baad aap dekh lena aage rakhna hai ya nahi.\n",
  "9": "Ruma: Theek hai, ek December se March ke exam tak. Paise kaise, mahine ke end mein?\n",
  "10": "Ankit: Pehle mahine ke do hazaar pehle din de dijiye, baaki do hazaar mahine ke end mein. Uske baad har mahine ki pehli tareekh ko poore chaar hazaar.\n",
  "11": "Ruma: Haan ye theek hai. Aur agar aap kisi din nahi aa paaye toh? College ke exam bhi toh honge aapke.\n",
  "12": "Ankit: Haan aunty, jo class miss hogi woh main Saturday ko cover kar dunga. Aur agar kabhi beech mein chhodna pada toh ek hafta pehle bataunga, aur us mahine jitne din padhaya utne ke hi paise lunga.\n",
  "13": "Ruma: Bilkul theek hai, fair hai. Toh pakka, ek December se.\n",
  "14": "Ankit: Haan pakka aunty.\n",
  "15": "Ruma: Waise aap khud kya padh rahe ho?\n",
  "16": "Ankit: BSc maths, final year, Hansraj se. Aage MSc ka socha hai, ya phir koi exam dunga.\n",
  "17": "Ruma: Arre wah, Hansraj. Mere bhai ka beta bhi wahin tha, commerce mein. Rohan ko bhi thoda samjhana, sirf phone pe cricket dekhta rehta hai.\n",
  "18": "Ankit: Haha, aaj toh match bhi hai na, India ka. Main bhi dekhunga shaam ko.\n",
  "19": "Ruma: Haan wahi toh, aaj toh woh padhega hi nahi. Kal ka score bhi subah subah poochh raha tha.\n",
  "20": "Ankit: Kal toh accha khela, last over mein jeete. Theek hai, pehle din Rohan se match ki baat karke hi dosti kar lunga.\n",
  "21": "Ruma: Haan woh accha rahega, woh thoda shy hai, naye logon se baat nahi karta.\n",
  "22": "Ankit: Koi baat nahi aunty, do teen din mein khul jaayega. Uski books kaun si hain, NCERT hi na?\n",
  "23": "Ruma: NCERT hai, aur ek RD Sharma bhi school ne lagwayi hai. Science mein ek lab manual bhi hai.\n",
  "24": "Ankit: Theek hai, RD Sharma toh mere paas hai. Main ek baar dekh lunga kaun se chapter chal rahe hain.\n",
  "25": "Ruma: Haan main uska syllabus WhatsApp kar dungi aapko. Aur ghar ka address bhi bhej deti hoon, C-block, Sector nine.\n",
  "26": "Ankit: Haan bhej dijiye. Sector nine toh mere ghar se das minute hai.\n",
  "27": "Ruma: Accha hai, phir toh barish mein bhi aa jaoge, haha.\n",
  "28": "Ankit: Haan haan aunty, barish ho ya match, aa jaaunga.\n",
  "29": "Ruma: Theek hai Ankit, toh phir milte hain ek tareekh ko. Bye.\n",
  "30": "Ankit: Ji aunty, namaste. Bye.\n"
 },
